# macOS writes these into any directory Finder has opened. Two were tracked, so
# every session working in the kit saw a dirty tree it had not made — and two
# sessions agreed today that committing named paths and leaving the tree CLEAN is
# the only thing that has kept them out of each other's way. Noise in `git status`
# costs that discipline directly.
#
# They never reached an archive: npm excludes .DS_Store from a package by default,
# and I checked four installed copies before writing this rather than assuming the
# `files: ["kit"]` field carried them.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Python leaves these beside the tools when a gate imports another gate.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# A local build of the kit's own pages, if anybody makes one.
dist/
node_modules/
